# blog-typography · Round 1

Vercel-article read craft — index as reading list, posts as measure-bound prose.

## Craft

- **Index**: `.post-index-title` (18px medium) + mono meta (date · read) + dek; hairline `divide-y`; `.row-interactive` hover wash
- **Empty**: `.blog-empty` — quiet text, no dashed card
- **Article shell**: `.article-shell` ~37.5rem (~65ch at 18px); `.article-title` display; `.article-dek`; `.post-meta`
- **MDX prose**: `.prose-blog` — 18/1.8 body, display h2/h3, amber underline links, code/blockquote/hr
- **Home**: compact teaser rows reuse index tokens (`.post-index-summary-sm`)

## Files

- `app/blog/page.tsx`, `app/blog/[slug]/page.tsx`
- `components/mdx.tsx`, `components/home-blog.tsx`
- `app/globals.css` — blog typography block

## Evidence

- `blog-index-desktop.png` / `blog-index-mobile.png`
- `blog-post-desktop.png` / `blog-post-mobile.png` (aliases: `article-desktop.png` / `article-mobile.png`)
- Optional: `article-scroll-desktop.png`, `article-desktop-light.png`

## Live

http://localhost:3000/blog · http://localhost:3000/blog/shipping-with-agents

